x_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rdcv4XS9WJthsDunK3o1icb25R93qTbzP7VFEoo9kicNPRYvbGTsOJCnwjq9P2uW0vc0P6WbnPb2bQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           庄园介绍\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          利巴多的希望庄园位于慧兰的皮塔利托镇，庄园的最高处可达海拔1850米。从3年前开始生产精品级别的咖啡。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          利巴多是第三代咖农，与我们在售卖的栎树同属于Chilito家族，庄园目前种植有瑰夏及粉红波旁，这里位于当地一处干净的天然泉水旁，处理用水取自天然山泉，他的侄女即栎树庄园的第四代咖农Alexandra在帮助其处理品质把控；\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          Libardo对咖啡进行有选择性的采收，具有严格的标准，并且通过浮选去除过度成熟干果，并进行手选鲜果，去除未熟果，之后进行发酵并进行晾晒。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Tu1AvnwIWrCMPj3E2W2BPsxYXqg6LF3KsyuLqaYS2uPMUGqh5icbLaqicDHyXKgWN3aibkkQ73DxFpg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 12px;\">\n          Libardo Chilito\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理细节\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n          鲜果咖啡鲜果在经过严格筛选后先去除果肉进行约36小时的湿发酵，然后置于带塑料顶棚避免阳光直射及雨水的晾晒房晾晒21天。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Tu1AvnwIWrCMPj3E2W2BPszMliaOCkABS354FlaXhWhJRia5aa0Du8DqplPic26CjhAph37GbZicrTlA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          文章内容和图片来自广州咖篮\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFV